{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/326857-transhuman-resources","id":326857,"title":"Transhuman Resources","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-01T05:27:56-08:00","id":326857,"title":"Transhuman Resources","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\">Hi people. I'm Wood. You may remember me from long ago as a fairly prolific contributor to White Wolf and Onyx Path's games. My stuff has appeared in Blood and Smoke, Requiem for Rome, the Mekhet and Nosferatu clanbooks, The Testament of Longinus, and a stack of others over the years. You might be interested to know that I'm in the process of writing a<span style=\"font-family:arial\">nd producing a comic in collaboration with K. Guillory of Detroit-based studio Ashur C</span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial\">ollective. <b><i>Transhuman Resources</i></b> is a blackly comic cyberpunk comic, whose transhuman, transnational and transgender protagonist navigates her way through a capitalist future where </span><span style=\"color:#2A2A2A\"><span style=\"font-family:Benton Sans\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">they've branded people-trafficking, fought wars over breakfast cereal, and founded time-travel temping agencies.<br /> We're dropping pages from our preview issue <a href=\"http://ashurcollective.com/transhuman-resources/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and you can preorder the finished graphic novel and see some preview material (including script pages) at our indiegogo campaign <a href=\"http://ashurcollective.com/transhuman-resources/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. We'd love you to take a look.</span><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://ashurcollective.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/11/cover.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date"